<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1188" title="View the profile of Vanayen">Vanayen</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1188"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:darkhunter75@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1618.msg17736#msg17736"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1618.msg17736#msg17736">Farewell EQ</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> July 15, 2005, 02:40:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Farewell EQ, I am done wiht this pathetic game.<br /><br />It came to where almost everyone got power hunry and were more in things for themselves so I have got fead up with trying<br />to ask fro help, the last guild I was in OA, every time I asked for help on ANYTHING, I got laughed at, the land of ignorance it was.<br /><br />Too many guilds have become obsessed with being the all mighty and powerful that they kill steal for a damn raid mob, and on accoutn of that, sony has had to go as high as Plane of Time to make zones instance in order to keep the peace.<br /><br />And what friends I have I next to never see anymore, but thankfully my IRL friends and I have all gone to somehting NOT run by sony, City of Heroes.<br /><br />They are not all about marketing and bugs seem to actually get worked on, and not to mention that the expansions are free through the patcher, so no spending over 100 bucks over the course of 6 years just to keep up with everyone in all the new zones.<br /><br />so no more feeling liek this&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /> for me.<br /><br />and all I can say to sony is&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /> you all need to actually start, listening to your own clients, and not your damn pockets.<br /><br />so good ridense&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
