							Awwww see ya later dear...&nbsp; I dont know you but if you were in my guild I would helped ya.&nbsp; &nbsp;I know how you feel sometimes wish you well in your future endeavors.<br /><br /><br /><br />Collleen Quickness<br />70 Ranger Inner Loop aka Coach Potatoes.
