							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Oh I did several times Whit, you may of not been around at the time, was always after raid that I brought it up, cause everyone was actually there to ask to get help the next day.<br /> and lets just say certain officers just found me funny to even ask, some said it was too easy.<br />and from what I read it would of been hard to do it solo, actually it was impossible.<br />So to say teh least it pissed me off that&nbsp; others woudl be helped and not me, it made me feel I had to get on peoples&#039; &quot;good list&quot; like I had to be among their favorites.<br /><br />It was not all ppl Whit, it was just certain ppl some of whom were officersand also ppl i thought I could rely on, it seems I got fooled.<br /><br />If I did ever come back if would be to the Firiona Vie server whee thee was more purpose then to be obsessed with &quot;most&quot; others&nbsp; who so badly want to make time ect.<br /><br />hey its liek DBZ, kill the next mob and power up to kill the next bigger one, some games are just more glamorous them others to that fashion.<br /><br />I believe how pl seem to leave guilds to get to a bigger guilds so they can be one of the bigger boys is a good example of that.<br /><br />if I have insulted anyone I apologize I am liek drunk due to a bad break up, so peace out and take care.<br /><br />oh and collen thanks, its nice some one will miss me <br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/inlove.gif" alt="inlove" border="0" />
						</td>
